title: Access to Windows Administrative Shares
status: experimental
description: Detects access to Windows administrative shares that may be associated with lateral movement.
references:
    - https://thedfirreport.com/2022/09/26/bumblebee-round-two/
    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/002/
author: Sümeyra Yüksel
date: 2026/10/27
tags:
    - attack.lateral-movement
    - attack.t1021.002
logsource:
    product: windows
    service: security
detection:
    selection:
        EventID: 5140
        ShareName|contains:
            - 'C$'
            - 'ADMIN$'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate remote administration
    - Software deployment and endpoint management
level: medium
